// Committed signing config for the DeckCheck app target.
//
// Your Apple Developer Team ID is personal and must NOT be committed, so it lives
// in Local.xcconfig (this folder), which is git-ignored. Copy Local.xcconfig.example
// → Local.xcconfig and set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM there.
//
// The include is optional (`#include?`) so a fresh clone without Local.xcconfig still
// opens/builds — Automatic signing will just prompt you to pick a team once.
//
// This is what keeps DEVELOPMENT_TEAM out of project.pbxproj, so `git pull` never
// conflicts on your signing settings again.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"
